; DIFFER IN THE EYE ROW ALONE -- 66 4E
; 1E 7E 78 71, two eyes tracking left to
; right and back -- and this milestone
; does NOT build them. They would be six
; more slots against two spare, and the
; slots M5 and M7 are holding are Otto's
; and the polish. The facing already
; moves the eyes, which is the half of
; the animation that carries meaning.
